                <mxCell id="s7_caption" value="&lt;b&gt;SID 9000035 · Cross-tier SSH (lateral movement)&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Attack: APP host attempts SSH (port 22) to WEB and DB tiers — workload tiers should never SSH between themselves.&#xa;Detection: Single-SYN match (no flow state needed); agent issues DROP + escalates host to &quot;suspicious&quot;." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#f9a825;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="s7_1">
